        "type": "text",
        "data": ["What is Cool Platformer?",
        "<p>
        Cool Platformer is a 3D Platformer inside the C# console app.\n\n
        I made it for SHiNE, A school assignment that gave us creative freedom to make something we would learn from.
        </p>"]
        },
        {
        "type": "images",
        "data": ["resources/portal.gif"]
        },
        {
        "type": "text",
        "data": ["Features in cool platformer",
        "<p>
        The game includes:\n
        - LAN Multiplayer\n
        - 256 Colors\n
        - Immersive portals (previous gif)\n
        - Custom formats for 3d models, animations, and rigs\n\n

        It's important to note i go into more depth in <a href='https://www.isomeone.nl/dev_docs/cool_platformer'>this document</a>\n
        And ofcourse the github repo <a href='https://github.com/FlorisTim/3D-platformer-in-the-c-console-app'>GitHub Repo</a>
        </p>"]
        },
        {
        "type": "text",
